Date: 2026-04-23
Descriptor: autonomous_sweep (validates ADR 0021)
Purpose:
    Verify that `autonomous_sweep` runs `autonomous_pass` once per
    requested size and that later sizes see earlier-named patterns
    in the registry (no cross-size duplicate naming). Also confirm
    second sweep on identical sizes is a no-op.

Mechanism version:
    ADR 0021 (RSet::autonomous_sweep).
    Runner: v2/examples/autonomous_sweep.rs.

Command:
    cargo run --example autonomous_sweep

